LineageOS 20.0 legacy compatibility manifest
============================================

This manifest follows LineageOS 20.0 and replaces only the shared repositories
needed by the legacy-device compatibility stack. Device-specific Xiaomi trees
are maintained separately and are not redirected to tiger-cave here.

Getting started
---------------

Initialize the source tree with this manifest:

```
repo init -u https://github.com/tiger-cave/android.git -b lineage-20.0 --git-lfs
```

Then sync all projects:

```
repo sync
```

Branch policy
-------------

`lineage-20.0` is the active, minimized compatibility branch. In repositories
cleaned on 2026-08-09, `lineage-20.0-bak` preserves the previous compatibility
history before unused patches were removed. The manifest always tracks the
active branch; backup branches are recovery points and are not synced.

The msm8960 CAF audio, display, and media projects use the dedicated
`lineage-20.0-caf-msm8960` branch.
